{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日\n8th singleのCDもらってきたよ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱジャケ写にいるのは嬉しい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごい顔でもw"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"表にいたのなんて\nおいシャンぶり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"複数枚買うんだったら\ntypeCを！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"友達に配るんだったら\ntypeCを！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よろしく！`・ω・´w"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「「答えちゃうお( °_ゝ°)ノ」」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"8thの曲の中でどれが一番気に入ってる？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\nまだ『気づいたら片想い』と『生まれたままで』しか聴けてないから\nわかんないけど\nメガシャキのCM見て可愛い曲だなって思った"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/03/27/3002780/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バニラロイヤルミルクティーってどこの？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\nDEAN & DELUCAのだよ〜(*°-°*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"車の免許持ってる？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n持ってる〜＼^^／\nこの前取得いたしました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/03/27/3002780/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん髪下ろした方が\nかわいいと思うけど、どう思う？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\nどのひめたんも可愛いけど\nうちはツインがいいと思うよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/03/27/3002780/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/03/27/3002780/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ジャケ写のときの制服。\nまだ泣く前(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木メ始まって\n1か月以上たったわけですね、早い"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だんだん慣れてきたよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログは\nお仕事関係、質問返し、日記っぽく"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木メは\nプライベート、リアルタイム、くだらないこと←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って感じに使い分け"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや〜\n写メが足らない足らない"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1日に10枚弱写メを使っちゃうってことは\n1日に10枚は写メ撮らなきゃいけない\nってことだよね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(゜ロ゜)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうそう\nついこの前"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真夏と二人して\n同じような内容を送ってたらしい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それぞれお互いの話でw"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"恥ずかしいぜ(*°-°*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他のメンバーの気になるな`・ω・´"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}